BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 628.0 Tm (larger storage systems.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 599.0 Tm (It is not interchangeable with UFS1. Neither should be described as having inherent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 582.0 Tm (ZFS-style snapshots, checksums or transactional copy-on-write. Filesystem features, write) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 565.0 Tm (durability and repair behaviour depend on precise FreeBSD implementations and mounted) Tj ET
